$scoreboard players set .YujiAwakening customAwakening $(duration)
scoreboard players operation .YujiAwakening customAwakening *= x20 customUniversal_MoveCooldowns
scoreboard players operation .YujiAwakeningDivided customAwakening = .YujiAwakening customAwakening
scoreboard players operation .YujiAwakeningThresholds customAwakening = .YujiAwakening customAwakening
scoreboard players operation .YujiAwakeningDivided customAwakening = .YujiAwakening customAwakening
scoreboard players operation .YujiAwakeningDivided customAwakening /= div16 customUniversal_MoveCooldowns

execute store result storage minecraft:custom yuji.hotbar.awakening.16 int 1 run scoreboard players get .YujiAwakeningThresholds customAwakening

